\"notice\":\"----------------------------------------------------------------------- Custom errors for gas-efficient revert reasons -----------------------------------------------------------------------\"}]},\"events\":{\"OwnershipTransferred(address,address)\":{\"notice\":\"Emitted when ownership is transferred from `previousOwner` to `newOwner`.\"},\"ScoreSubmitted(bytes32,bytes32,uint32,address)\":{\"notice\":\"Emitted when a score is submitted for a tournament.\"},\"TournamentCreated(bytes32,address,uint64)\":{\"notice\":\"Emitted when a new tournament is created.\"}},\"kind\":\"user\",\"methods\":{\"constructor\":{\"notice\":\"Construct the contract and set the deployer as the initial owner.\"},\"createTournament(bytes32)\":{\"notice\":\"Create a new tournament with id `tournamentId`.\"},\"getEntryCount(bytes32)\":{\"notice\":\"Number of entries submitted for `tournamentId`.\"},\"getTournamentEntries(bytes32,uint256,uint256)\":{\"notice\":\"Return a page (slice) of entries for a tournament. Safer than copying the entire leaderboard.\"},\"owner()\":{\"notice\":\"The owner with permission to create tournaments and transfer ownership.\"},\"submitScore(bytes32,bytes32,uint32)\":{\"notice\":\"Submit an entry for `tournamentId`.\"},\"tournamentExists(bytes32)\":{\"notice\":\"Check whether a tournament has been created (cheap off-chain check).\"},\"transferOwnership(address)\":{\"notice\":\"Transfer contract ownership to `newOwner`.\"}},\"notice\":\"Lightweight append-only on-chain storage for tournament score submissions. Design goals: 1. Keep on-chain logic minimal and cheap: store entries (nicknameHash, score) in insertion order. 2. Prevent duplicate submissions per tournament using a mapping of nickname hashes. 3. Allow a single on-chain owner (deployer) to create tournaments; score submissions are open to any account. Notes: - nicknameHash is expected to be keccak256(lowercase(nickname)) to avoid case collisions; the contract stores the hash only. - Leaderboard 